OL,3,GNEWSAPolice help influencer escape city
OL,4,Acentre crowds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA TikTok star says he was helped by
OL,7,Fpolice to evade large crowds by going
OL,8,Fthrough a pub's back entrance after a
OL,9,Fvisit to a city caused commotion.
OL,11,FJ2Hundred, who live streams on TikTok
OL,12,Fand Kick, said the turnout took him by
OL,13,Fsurprise when visiting Norwich on
OL,14,FTuesday and he has subsequently cut
OL,15,Fshort a tour of East Anglia.
OL,17,FNorfolk Police received several calls
OL,18,Fabout large groups of young people
OL,19,Fgathering but found there was no
OL,20,Fcriminality taking place.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
