OL,3,GNEWSAPolice help influencer escape city
OL,4,Acentre crowds
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing the experience, the creator
OL,7,Fsaid "it got a bit hectic" and that  he
OL,8,Fwas considering getting more security
OL,9,Fwhen making similar live stream videos
OL,10,Fin the future.
